<article>
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Sub-processors</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated <span class="ph">[go-live date]</span></p>
    <p>These companies process data from your workspace on our behalf. All are EU companies, processing in the EU, under a data
      processing agreement with us. The list is part of appendix B of our <a href="/dpa">data processing agreement</a>.</p>

    <h2 id="list">Sub-processors</h2>
    <div class="tbl"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>What they do for Kupro</th><th>Data</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>OVHcloud</b><br>OVH SAS, France</td><td>Servers, database, file storage, backups</td><td>All workspace and account data</td><td>France</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Scaleway</b><br>Scaleway SAS, France</td><td>Sending email</td><td>Recipient address, email content</td><td>Paris, France</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Scaleway</b><br>Scaleway SAS, France</td><td>Meeting agent: speech-to-text and suggested changes. Only when your workspace runs a meeting session</td><td>Seconds of audio, transcript text, issue titles</td><td>Paris, France</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2 id="other">Other vendors</h2>
    <p>These handle data we control about the paying company, not the content of your workspace.</p>
    <div class="tbl"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>What for</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Alunta</td><td>Subscriptions and invoices</td><td>Denmark</td></tr>
        <tr><td><span class="ph">[OnPay or QuickPay, chosen before billing starts]</span></td><td>Card payments</td><td>Denmark</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PingPuffin</td><td>Checks from outside that Kupro is up. Calls a public health address only; sees no personal data</td><td>Denmark</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2 id="not">What we don't use</h2>
    <p>No US cloud providers, no third-party analytics, no advertising networks, no error-tracking SaaS. Logs, traces and metrics run
      on our own servers. Our source code is on GitHub, which stores no customer data.</p>

    <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
    <p>Before we add or replace a sub-processor, we email workspace owners at least 30 days ahead and update this page. If you object
      for a reasonable data protection reason, tell us at <a href="mailto:contact@kupro.app">contact@kupro.app</a> within those 30 days. We will try to find a
      solution; if we can't, you can end your subscription and we refund prepaid fees for the remaining period.</p>
    <p>Want the email? Workspace owners get it automatically. Others can subscribe at <a href="mailto:contact@kupro.app">contact@kupro.app</a>.</p>
  </article>
